        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Optional validator / canonicaliser, applied before a write that comes in through the string facade. It is a member function of the solver, so it can consult solver state without the setting holding a back-pointer <ndash/> which would dangle the first time the solver was moved. Null means &quot;store the value as given&quot;. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
