    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A setting holding a value of type T.</para>
<para>The implicit conversion means the solver body can keep using a setting exactly like the plain member it replaced <ndash/> <computeroutput>if(verbosity_ &gt;= 5)</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>x * diis_epsilon_</computeroutput> <ndash/> and operator= keeps internal writes (which are not subject to the writable flag) equally plain. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
